    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d49-a2">

                <pb facs="0117" n="49" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg49"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Belgium</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Whitlock</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Chief of the Political
                        Department of the German General Government in Belgium</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Von der Lancken</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 6614</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister of the United States presents his compliments to His Excellency
                    Baron von der Lancken and has the honor to remind him of his letter of August
                    31, relative to the arrest of Miss Cavell to which letter he has not yet
                    received an answer.</p>
                <p>As the Minister has been urged by a despatch<anchor n="3" xml:id="d49-f1"/> to
                    occupy himself immediately with the defense of Miss Cavell, he would be greatly
                    obliged to His Excellency Baron von der Lancken if he would enable him to take
                    immediately the measures necessary for this action and to reply by telegram to
                    the despatch which he has received.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Brussels</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-10">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 10, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d49-f1" n="3" xml:id="d49-f1-content">
                <p>No copy enclosed with this despatch.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
